---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — ihor.me" description="How ihor.me collects, uses, and protects your personal information.">
  <section class="legal-section">
    <div class="u---spacer is--full"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-content" data-reveal>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-content_meta"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> February 15, 2026</p>

        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>Welcome to <strong>ihor.me</strong> (the "Website"). This Website is owned and operated by <strong>PE Ihor Ivanchenko</strong> ("I," "me," or "my").</p>
        <p>I respect your privacy and am committed to protecting the personal information you share with me. This Privacy Policy explains what information I collect, how I use it, and your rights regarding your data.</p>
        <p>By using this Website, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.</p>

        <h2>2. Information I Collect</h2>
        <p>I collect information that you voluntarily provide to me when you use the contact form on my Website. This includes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Name:</strong> To address you properly.</li>
          <li><strong>Email Address:</strong> To reply to your inquiry.</li>
          <li><strong>Project Details:</strong> Information about your project requirements and budget preferences (via the form selection).</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
        <p>I do not use third-party analytics (like Google Analytics) or advertising trackers. However, my hosting provider (<strong>Webflow</strong>) may collect standard server logs (IP address, browser type) and use essential cookies strictly necessary for the Website's security and proper operation.</p>

        <h2>3. How I Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>I use the collected data solely for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your inquiries and discuss potential collaboration.</li>
          <li>To facilitate the scheduling of a call via <strong>Cal.com</strong> (to which you are redirected after form submission).</li>
          <li>To provide the services you requested.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>I do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties.</p>

        <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>To operate this Website and provide my services, I use the following trusted third-party service providers:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Webflow:</strong> The Website is hosted on Webflow. Data submitted through the contact form is processed and stored securely by Webflow. You can read Webflow's Privacy Policy <a href="https://webflow.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Cal.com:</strong> After submitting the contact form, you may be redirected to Cal.com to schedule a meeting. Any information you provide directly to Cal.com is governed by their privacy policy.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
        <p>I do not use tracking or advertising cookies. The Website may use <strong>essential cookies</strong> provided by Webflow that are necessary for the site to function securely (for example, to prevent cross-site request forgery attacks on forms). These cookies do not track your browsing history across other websites.</p>

        <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>I retain your personal information only for as long as is necessary to fulfill the purposes set out in this Privacy Policy, or as required by law.</p>

        <h2>7. Your Data Protection Rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>The right to access:</strong> You have the right to request copies of your personal data.</li>
          <li><strong>The right to rectification:</strong> You have the right to request that I correct any information you believe is inaccurate.</li>
          <li><strong>The right to erasure:</strong> You have the right to request that I erase your personal data ("Right to be Forgotten").</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact me at the email address below.</p>

        <h2>8. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>I may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. I will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date at the top.</p>

        <h2>9. Contact Me</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how I handle your data, please contact me:</p>
        <p><strong>PE Ihor Ivanchenko</strong></p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@ihor.me">hello@ihor.me</a></p>
        <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://ihor.me" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://ihor.me</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="u---spacer"></div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script is:inline src="/scripts/site.js"></script>
